und-color:rgb(245,242,240)\"> </span>Candida_parapsilosis.bed <br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">next</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">gene.obj=readTranscriptFeatures(system.file(&quot;extdata&quot;,&quot;Candida_parapsilosis.bed&quot;,package = &quot;methylKit&quot;))</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><b>Reading the table...</b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><b>Calculating intron coordinates...</b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><b>Error in rep(1:nrow(ref), ref[, 10]) : argomento &#39;times&#39; non valido</b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><b>Inoltre: Warning message:</b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><b>In `[.data.frame`(ref, rep(1:nrow(ref), ref